      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过一整个夏天拼命地调养，\n曼城茶座身体的异常状况\n稍稍获得了改善。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a559ab031723d0e154ec7363c4be87cc6bf64e20419e93b841be9653a2b2c95",
