      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗨，训练员。\n这个夏天，你和茶座的进度如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6b6e99f10a4e90f0d266e39282c6aa5ca291d5d209f8592b035678de2d4ed28",
