      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此，虽说有些难以理解的行动，\n但大多时候都对咖啡有利啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54bf73626cad0f5c350e46b9cfe8ce7a1c03b561d022cd6807d5957c16e23985",
